ndead pin setups, splits & washouts\n\u2022 Speed Bowl: Drop the most zombies against the clock\n\u2022 Practice: Free throw, no pressure\n\u2022 Tournament: Spend scrap to enter, beat rival survivors\n\u2022 Extreme: Shambling moving targets, 2x rewards\n\u2022 Career: Rise from Survivor to Apocalypse Legend\n\u2022 Trick Shot & Spare Challenge: bonus-scrap objectives\n\n\ud83d\udc80 NINE CURSED BALLS\nFire Skull, Frost Wraith, Galaxy Reaper, Golden Idol, Hex Orb, Plasma Soul, Inferno Core, Thunder Crypt & Cosmic Doom \u2014 each with haunting trails.\n\n\ud83e\udea6 NINE HAUNTED LANES\nNeon Necropolis, Space Tomb, Drowned Graveyard, Retro Horror, Lava Pit, Frozen Grave, Cursed Jungle, Blood Sunset & Midnight Cemetery.\n\n\u26a1 FEATURES\n\u2022 Bone-crunching pin physics & undead knockdowns\n\u2022 Power-ups: Guide Line, Slow Motion, Skull Magnet, Second Chance\n\u2022 Daily & weekly challenges, Lucky Spin, Season Pass, login bonuses\n\u2022 Global leaderboards, custom ball creator & alley customization\n\u2022 4 difficulty levels & multiple oil patterns for real bowling depth\n\nArcade horror bowling \u2014 grab your ball, brace for the horde, and STRIKE!", "short_description": "\ud83e\udddf Strike down the undead in Zombie Strike VR \u2014 classic bowling reborn as graveyard horror! Hurl cursed balls down haunted lanes to smash waves of zombie skulls across 9 blood-soaked game modes. Unlock 9 sinister balls with ghostly trails, customize 9 eerie crypt lanes, and climb from Survivor to Apocalypse Legend. Daily challenges, Lucky Spin, Career & Tournament await. Bone-crunching pin physics meet undead mayhem \u2014 grab your ball and bring the carnage!"}]}, "developer_name": "NVR Labs", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://zombie-strike-privacy.pages.dev/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NVR Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://zombie-strike-website.pages.dev/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COM